    <div class="reveal core-insight">
      <span class="core-insight-quote" aria-hidden="true">"</span>
      <p>Most brands do not struggle because they lack effort. They struggle because <span class="hl-teal">clarity</span>, <span class="hl-honey">direction</span>, and <span class="hl-mint">action</span> rarely work together.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Problem / Belief — horizontal cards: illustration LEFT, content RIGHT -->
