              <rect x="98" y="34" width="26" height="26" rx="5" fill="rgba(238,90,24,0.10)" stroke="#EE5A18" stroke-width="2" transform="rotate(14 111 47)"/>
              <rect x="156" y="62" width="26" height="26" rx="5" fill="rgba(238,90,24,0.18)" stroke="#EE5A18" stroke-width="2" transform="rotate(-8 169 75)"/>
              <rect x="70" y="100" width="26" height="26" rx="5" fill="rgba(238,90,24,0.12)" stroke="#EE5A18" stroke-width="2" transform="rotate(18 83 113)"/>
              <rect x="128" y="106" width="26" height="26" rx="5" fill="rgba(238,90,24,0.18)" stroke="#EE5A18" stroke-width="2" transform="rotate(-16 141 119)"/>
            </g>
            <g stroke="#EE5A18" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.9">
              <line x1="190" y1="116" x2="206" y2="132"/>
              <line x1="206" y1="116" x2="190" y2="132"/>
            </g>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="pb-body">
          <div class="pb-head"><span class="pb-num">01</span> The Core Challenge</div>
          <p>When clarity is missing, decisions become reactive. When direction is unclear, effort gets scattered. And when both are misaligned, momentum never builds. Real progress begins when clarity defines the direction and direction creates steady momentum — that is when marketing stops feeling random and starts working like a structured engine.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pb-card reveal" data-accent="honey">
        <div class="pb-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 220 160" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
