    <!-- WHY / WHAT / HOW — circular icon at top -->
    <div class="why-what-how">
      <div class="wwh-card reveal" data-accent="teal">
        <div class="wwh-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M2 12s3.6-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3.6 7-10 7S2 12 2 12z"/>
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.2"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="wwh-tag">WHY</div>
        <h3>Because brands are built by how people think about them.</h3>
        <p>Most businesses invest heavily in communication, platforms, and campaigns, yet very few invest enough time in understanding how their brand actually exists in the minds of customers. We believe the real advantage comes from <strong>shaping perception first</strong> and amplifying visibility later.</p>
        <div class="wwh-foot"><span>01</span><span>Perception · Architecture</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="wwh-card reveal" data-accent="honey">
        <div class="wwh-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <rect x="3.5" y="15" width="17" height="3.4" rx="1.2"/>
            <rect x="6" y="10" width="12" height="3.4" rx="1.2"/>
            <rect x="8.5" y="5" width="7" height="3.4" rx="1.2"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="wwh-tag">WHAT</div>
        <h3>We work on the architecture behind how a brand grows.</h3>
        <p>Platform Play Venture focuses on the <strong>thinking layer</strong> that sits beneath marketing activity — how the brand is positioned, how decisions are taken, how technology supports the journey, and how everything connects to the long-term vision.</p>
        <div class="wwh-foot"><span>02</span><span>Thinking · Layer</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="wwh-card reveal" data-accent="mint">
        <div class="wwh-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <circle cx="9" cy="14" r="5.6"/>
            <circle cx="15" cy="14" r="5.6"/>
            <circle cx="12" cy="8.5" r="5.6"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="wwh-tag">HOW</div>
        <h3>By combining clarity, behavioural understanding, and structured decision-making.</h3>
        <p>The strongest brands are not always the loudest. They are the ones built on <strong>clear thinking, deep understanding of customer behaviour</strong>, and systems that support consistent progress over time.</p>
        <div class="wwh-foot"><span>03</span><span>System · Build</span></div>
      </div>
